     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Key idea",
     "texto": [
      "With zijn, use ben + past participle with verbs like aankomen and beginnen. Unlike English, which always uses «have» («I have arrived»), Dutch uses «ben» with these verbs."
     ],
